    "_note": "The Ensign Group's 10-K does not disclose individual facility names, cities, or Medicare CCNs. The filing provides only aggregate facility counts by state: CA (70 facilities), TX (83), AZ (36), WI (2), UT (21), CO (25), WA (16), ID (12), NE (7), KS (8), IA (6), SC (9), NV (2), totaling 297 facilities as of December 31, 2023. The filing indicates 259 skilled nursing operations and 38 senior living operations, with approximately 30,602 operational skilled nursing beds and 3,121 senior living units. Subsequent to year-end, the company expanded into Tennessee (2 facilities, 241 beds). No CCNs or specific facility identifiers are provided in this filing. The company operates through independent subsidiaries organized into portfolio companies, which may explain the lack of individual facility disclosure."
